<title>USA: Hilfiger, Stride Rite in licensing pact.</title>
<headline>Hilfiger, Stride Rite in licensing pact.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tommy Hilfiger Corp said Monday that it has signed a licensing agreement with Stride Rite Corp to produce a complete line of women's footwear.</p>
<p>Terms of the agreement were not disclosed.</p>
</text>
